<report>
<title>General agreement over all categories (2 raters)</title>

<p><u>Cohen's kappa (unweighted)</u><br />
Observed agreement = @po%<br />
Expected agreement = @pe%<br />
Kappa = @{kappa:roundu} (se_0 = @{se:roundu}, se = @{seci:roundu})<br />
<ci>@{pc:roundu}% confidence interval = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci><br />
z (for k = 0) = @z<br />
<pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

<p><u>Cohen's kappa (weighted by @methodName)</u><br />
ratings weighted by:</p>
<table>
<block name="weights"><tr><block name="tot"><td>@tot</td></block></tr></block>
</table>
<p>Observed agreement = @pow%<br />
Expected agreement = @pew%<br />
Kappa = @{kappaw:roundu} (se_0 = @{sekw:roundu}, se = @{sekwci:roundu})<br />
<ci>@pcw% confidence interval for kappa = @{fromw:roundu} to @{tow:roundu}</ci><br />
z (for kw = 0) = @{zw:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{pw:pval}</pval></p>

<p><u>Scott's pi</u><br />
Observed agreement = @pocopy%<br />
Expected agreement = @spe%<br />
Pi = @{spi:roundu}</p>
<block name="deci"><p><ci>@pc% Donner-Eliasziw confidence interval = @{lwr:roundu} to @{upr:roundu}</ci></p></block>

<p><u>Gwet's AC1</u><br />
Observed agreement = @gamapc%<br />
Chance-independent agreement = @pegamapc%<br />
AC1 = @{gama:roundu} (se = @{segama:roundu})<br />
<ci>@pc% confidence interval = @{gamacil:roundu} to @{gamaciu:roundu}</ci></p>

<title>Disagreement over any category and asymmetry of disagreement (2 raters)</title>

<p>Marginal homogeneity (Maxwell) chi-square = @{x2:roundu}  df = @{df:roundu}  <pval>@{pmaxwell:pval}</pval></p>

<p>Symmetry (generalised McNemar) chi-square = @{x2m:roundu}  df = @dfmcnemar  <pval>@{pmcnemar:pval}</pval></p>
</report>
